(5936, 'Another rare composition with cats taking on human roles is the painting of the Barber shop, in the Kunsthistorisches Museum in Vienna. Several versions of this composition are known.', '', '', ''),
(5937, '', '', '', ''),
(5938, 'There are several version of this artwork...', 'Известно несколько версий этой картины: \n<ul>\n   <li> _AO_ https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:David_Teniers_the_Younger_-_Puffspieler_in_einem_Wirtshaus.jpg;Эта, хранящаяся в Gemäldegalerie, Берлин _AC_ </li>\n   <li> _AO_ http://www.sothebys.com/en/auctions/ecatalogue/2011/old-master-and-british-paintings-evening-sale/lot.16.html; Проданая на Sothebys в 2011 _AC_ </li>\n   <li> _AO_ http://www.nationaltrustcollections.org.uk/object/1246499.2#content; Хранящаяся в <i> Polesden Lacey National Trust Images/Prudence Cuming </i> _AC_ </li>\n   <li> _AO_ http://lunacommons.org/luna/servlet/detail/AMICO~1~1~34495~60115; Хранящаяся в <i> the AMICA Library, the Cleveland Museum of Art </i> _AC_ </li>\n \n</ul>\n', '', ''),
